{
 "_note": "「从我的仓库挑」:令牌主人最近推送的 30 个仓库(含协作 / 组织成员),供首页添加关注位。只在用户打开添加面板时调。\n⚠️ 刻意不整份透传:pluck 成平行数组,页面按下标 zip(VParser 没有 map)。30 个完整仓库对象约 90KB,页面只用 5 个字段。\n【G23 豁免】添加面板里的一次性列表,用户点开就是要看此刻的仓库,缓存与目的相悖。",
 "version": 1,
 "_lintCache": "exempt",
 "actions": [
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "hdr",
    "value": {
     "Accept": "application/vnd.github+json",
     "User-Agent": "Numable"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "resp",
   "action": "request",
   "params": {
    "url": "https://api.github.com/user/repos?sort=pushed&per_page=30&affiliation=owner,collaborator,organization_member",
    "method": "GET",
    "header": "${hdr}",
    "formatType": "json",
    "credential": "gh"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "_b",
    "value": "1"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "n",
    "value": "$[length::(${resp})]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "names",
    "value": "$[pluck::(${resp},name)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "owners",
    "value": "$[pluck::(${resp},owner.login)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "langs",
    "value": "$[pluck::(${resp},language)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "stars",
    "value": "$[pluck::(${resp},stargazers_count)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "privs",
    "value": "$[pluck::(${resp},private)]"
   }
  },
  {
   "action": "resultFilter",
   "params": {
    "keys": [
     "n",
     "names",
     "owners",
     "langs",
     "stars",
     "privs"
    ]
   }
  }
 ]
}
